---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import en from '../i18n/en.json';

const lang = 'en';
const dict = en;
---

<Layout
  lang={lang}
  title="Privacy Policy | DJ Fruits and Dry Fruits Exports"
  description="Our simple, transparent policy regarding farmer phone numbers and procurement inquiries."
  canonicalPath="/privacy"
>
  <div class="section-opaque legal-page">
    <div class="container legal-container">
      <h1 class="legal-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-date">Last updated: 11 October 2026</p>

      <div class="legal-content">
        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          We only collect contact and agricultural data you voluntarily provide when using our digital weighing slip or contact form:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your name and WhatsApp mobile phone number.</li>
          <li>Your farm location (village, taluka, district).</li>
          <li>Details regarding crop varieties, estimated weight, and harvest schedule.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. How We Use Your Data</h2>
        <p>
          Your information is solely used by our procurement team to communicate current modal market rates, schedule farm inspection, and arrange collection logistics. We never sell, rent, or distribute grower contact information to third-party marketing companies.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Data Storage & Security</h2>
        <p>
          We do not store passwords, credit cards, or financial account credentials on this website. Payments are handled via direct bank RTGS / NEFT following verification at our Manerajuri packhouse.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          For privacy inquiries or deletion of your contact details from our records, contact us at: <br />
          Email: <a href="mailto:dj.fruitsanddryfruitsexports@gmail.com">dj.fruitsanddryfruitsexports@gmail.com</a><br />
          Phone: +91 9130659595
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 4.5rem 0 6rem;
  }
  .legal-container {
    max-width: 780px;
  }
  .legal-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--canopy);
  }
  .legal-date {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .legal-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: var(--canopy);
    margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
  }
  .legal-content p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .legal-content ul {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .legal-content a {
    color: var(--leaf);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
